reviews.text:
I feel completely biased when talking about Cetra Vet, the clinic my dog ​​goes to, because the service from the entire team is simply incredible, always guided by respect and empathy.
Thor has been a patient at the clinic for just over 4 years. Recently, he needed to undergo serious emergency surgery, and all the care, from the first moment to the post-operative follow-up, was extremely efficient and professional. In addition to the technical competence, I was welcomed with unparalleled care and sensitivity, both with my four-legged son and with me, as his owner. I fully trust the professionals who know his history and needs.

I would like to express my deep gratitude to everyone involved in this journey over these years, especially to the professionals who were essential during this critical time:
- Dr. Fabiana: for the impeccable surgery;
- Dr. Maria Sol, Amanda, and Nathalia: for the excellent care of Thor during his hospitalization;
- Alyandara (anesthesiologist): for the meticulous care and for explaining every detail of the process so clearly;

- Evando (nurse): for the care and dedication throughout the entire period;

- Bruna and Lorhoama: for the constant attention and affection at reception;

- Dr. Juliana (Thor's veterinarian): for being our reference, always available and caring for him, even when she is not on duty.

I also want to highlight the impeccable hygiene of the hospitalization area, which remains extremely clean and free of any odor, which brings even more peace of mind to the owners.

I am sure that I made the best possible choice to take care of my four-legged son. Thank you for everything!
